# Galuf's Final Act ({1}{G}) on Bot1's Llanowar Elves (1/1): it gets +1/+0, 2/1 until end of turn, and gains "When this creature
# dies, put a number of +1/+1 counters equal to its power on up to one target creature" (CR 611.2a, 613.1f). Lightning Bolt kills
# it the same turn; the power it last had on the battlefield is 2, the +1/+0 included (CR 603.10a, 608.2h), so two counters go on
# Bot2's Steel Wall (0/4), which becomes 2/6 - the toughness is unchanged. A noncreature, Bot1's Mox Ruby, is no legal target.
# The three mana of Black Lotus pay Elves ({G}) and Galuf's Final Act ({1}{G}) exactly.

